//""","""//     opc.mjs tools  <package> [--prefix /opt/opc-agent] [--check]
//     opc.mjs client plan|deploy|tools <client-dir>
//
// A client is a directory with client.yaml: the client's workspace, members,
// runtime, the {{VAR}} values, secret files and the sets (packages) they
// bought. `client` checks the sets against each other, then runs tools, plan
// or deploy for every set into that one workspace.
